{"id":"ohnma_chtig","lemma":"ohnmächtig","pos":"adj","rank":2693,"glosses":["unconscious (Having lost consciousness for a short time as in ohnmächtig werden (\"to faint, to pass out\").)","powerless, helpless"],"ipa":"/ˈoːnˌmɛçtɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/De-ohnm%C3%A4chtig.ogg/De-ohnm%C3%A4chtig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"ohnmächtiger","superlative":"am ohnmächtigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie ist ohnmächtig.","en":"She's unconscious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393476","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie wurde fast ohnmächtig.","en":"She almost passed out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756201","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"almost"},null]},{"text":"Ich glaube, ich werde ohnmächtig.","en":"I think I'm going to faint.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/592969","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Bist du wirklich ohnmächtig geworden?","en":"Did you really faint?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"really, actually"},null,{"g":"become, got"}]},{"text":"Ich bin noch nie ohnmächtig geworden.","en":"I've never fainted before.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"become, got"}]}]}